{
  "description": "Production-possibilities frontier engine — the learner drags an allocation slider dividing resources between two goods, reads the marginal opportunity cost, and toggles an idle-resources demo that drops actual output inside the frontier, on a math-canvas. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
  "ledger": {
    "entries": {
      "ent_01KZEEZFY8CMGFGK9Y7MFFN46F": {
